Railway’s Containment Steps
As a defensive measure, Railway temporarily halted builds and deployments. It also limited the dashboard and the API. The company revoked Railway API tokens itself, including previously created Project Tokens, and replaced cloud storage credentials.
Some users also had to reconnect certain GitHub integrations. The pause complicated secret rotation, since new settings could not be applied at once to running applications.

